WEBVTT

00:04:27.781 --> 00:04:30.884
Ne ishim aty.

00:04:30.884 --> 00:04:33.028
Dua te theksoj se ne ate liste na shoqeronin

00:04:33.028 --> 00:04:35.526
edhe shume qytete te famshme.

00:04:35.526 --> 00:04:36.749
(te qeshura)

00:04:36.749 --> 00:04:40.005
Dallas, Houston dhe New Orleans

00:04:40.005 --> 00:04:41.715
apo Atlanta dhe Miami.

00:04:41.715 --> 00:04:43.212
Ne pergjithesi keto jane qytete me te cilat

00:04:43.212 --> 00:04:45.860
gjithkush do te donte te krahasohej.

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:50.128
E megjithate, mua nuk me pelqeu 
te isha pjese e asaj liste.

00:04:50.128 --> 00:04:54.473
Ato kohe u ngjita ne peshore.

00:04:54.473 --> 00:04:56.599
Peshoja 110 kg.

00:04:56.599 --> 00:04:58.102
U futa ne nje website

00:04:58.102 --> 00:04:59.952
te sponsorizuar nga qeveria,

00:04:59.952 --> 00:05:03.625
dhe hodha gjatesine time, peshen,